WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose the channel
Open Settings & channels, then Channels, and choose Facebook.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Complete the authorization
Press connect and complete the sign-in and authorization in the provider's window. Choose the account or page you need and grant the required permissions.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Check the result
Go back to Channels and review the connection status, then test receiving a message from another account. Availability of the connection may vary with the service's settings.
